<title>THAILAND: Siam Commercial Bank cuts lending rate.</title>
<headline>Siam Commercial Bank cuts lending rate.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's Siam Commercial Bank cut its Minimum Retail Rate (MRR) by 25 basis points to 13.50 percent with immediate effect, a bank official said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The bank's Minimum Lending Rate (MLR) and Minimum Overdraft Rate (MOR) remained unchanged at 13.50 and 13.75 percent respectively, the official told Reuters.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
</text>
